{"reviewId": "3126459_81sN5PwX8", "review": {"abstract": "2019年，当东方国家启动房地产周期后，繁荣从西半球转到东半球，那时候美元就变成熊市", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "18 演讲实录：人生就是一场康波", "chapterUid": 23, "content": "会看这本书，对房地产周期的预测失真较大。这个系统性问题是一个值得研究的大课题，我们这边是政策体系大大延缓了地产风险出清吗？低点从2019推迟到了2026？美国那边繁荣时间也超过了原本时长。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "11380-11422", "createTime": 1751877843, "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "3126459_81sN5PwX8", "userVid": 3126459, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 23, "chapterTitle": "18 演讲实录：人生就是一场康波", "author": {"userVid": 3126459, "name": "firstprinciple", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/XYrRG5UShDd1OS4NmWmYVvGiahSoB8vicj5rBuDzEmgHdlDvOsl7jtCScOZuryFyyUSvvBSiaqaEak/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "firstprinciple", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-1000", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 1000}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 7, "likes": [{"userVid": 14114501, "name": "青峰 ", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/0CsLVOos5jPbXIZTDd3OYFHxQbw1WjlgwP0dlUfLLB67zgweyW7vYEibOtlCybrhQdoBpUOLWs9cGibMGia3ERKwA/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M15-1-0", "desc": "21天阅读挑战", "title": "21天阅读挑战", "levelIndex": 0}}], "commentsCount": 3, "hotComments": [], "comments